  "html": "<table>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Snow_sanctuary.jpg\" title=\"Snow sanctuary.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"318\" src=\"/images/Snow_sanctuary.jpg\" width=\"250\"/></a>\n</td><td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Snowmen.jpg\" title=\"Snowmen.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"180\" src=\"/images/Snowmen.jpg\" width=\"250\"/></a>\n</td><td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Snow_runts.jpg\" title=\"Snow runts.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"275\" src=\"/images/Snow_runts.jpg\" width=\"190\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Typical Map\n</td><td>Some of the Snowmen in the Sanctuary\n</td><td>The Ice Runts as \"Snowmen\"!\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p>The Sanctuary is a special dungeon, accessible only through <a href=\"/wiki/Shivery_the_Incorrigible_Snowman\" title=\"Shivery the Incorrigible Snowman\">Shivery the Incorrigible Snowman</a>. Probably it will only be available through the Winter Season.  It is of the <a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Cave_Layout\" title=\"Ice Cave Layout\">Ice Cave Layout</a>.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Monsters\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Monsters</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Orok_Juggernaut\" title=\"Ice Orok Juggernaut\">Ice Orok Juggernaut</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Snow_Monsters_Best_Friend\" title=\"Snow Monsters Best Friend\">Snow Monsters Best Friend</a>, Ice <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Shaman\" title=\"Orok Shaman\">Orok Shaman</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Orok_Runt\" title=\"Ice Orok Runt\">Ice Orok Runt</a> (some of them are snowman themed), <a href=\"/wiki/Snow_Warg\" title=\"Snow Warg\">Snow Pup</a>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Specials\"></a><h3> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Specials</span></h3>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/Abominable_Snow_Dog\" title=\"Abominable Snow Dog\">Abominable Snow Dog</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/Snow_Monster\" title=\"Snow Monster\">Snow Monster</a> are found here.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
}
